格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"鲸影 DSH Video Studio：DeepSeek Harness 原生视频/漫剧生成插件——六段导演流水线、多供应商免费额度调度、四层提示词自优化，质量优先省钱第二","id":"gh:1335889083","install_available":true,"language":"JavaScript","name":"dsh-video-studio","slug":"hackerFish/dsh-video-studio","topics":["ai-image","ai-video","chinese","comic-drama","deepseek","deepseek-harness","dsh","dsh-plugin","motion-comic","video-generation"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"鲸影 DSH Video Studio：DeepSeek Harness 原生视频/漫剧生成插件——六段导演流水线、多供应商免费额度调度、四层提示词自优化，质量优先省钱第二"},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# 🐳 dsh-video-studio (Whale) — AI Video & Motion-Comic Studio for DeepSeek Harness"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"**A DeepSeek Harness native plugin for AI video and motion-comic (漫剧) production: seven-stage direct"},{"id":"p3s2","text":"or pipeline × multi-account quota pool with failure fallback × credential vault × four-layer prompt "},{"id":"p3s3","text":"engineering with a score-feedback loop. Quality first, cost second.**"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"中文 · Siblings: dsh-lab · awesome-dsh-skills · awesome-dsh-presets"},{"id":"p5s1","text":"> The DSH ecosystem has 1000+ plugins — none does generative video. Whale brings the industry-valida"},{"id":"p5s2","text":"ted motion-comic pipeline (waoowaoo / LumenX / MangaV / ArcReel pattern) into DSH as a hot-pluggable"},{"id":"p5s3","text":", per-step-controllable plugin."},{"id":"p6s1","text":"**Live demo — real AI-generated video (wan2.2-t2v-plus, DashScope, 1080p 5s):**"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"Quantified project assessment"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"## Pipeline — the industry-standard seven-stage workflow"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"- **The first three stages are LLM stages**: inside DSH the session model itself does them — the mod"},{"id":"p10s2","text":"el you're chatting with (Doubao, DeepSeek, whatever) is the brain that writes the story, script and "},{"id":"p10s3","text":"shots; the plugin never calls an external LLM."},{"id":"p11s1","text":"**Mapping to the industry-standard toolchain**:"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"| Industry flow | Whale |"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"| Doubao writes novel / script / shots | = DSH session model doing story/script/storyboard (pick a D"},{"id":"p13s2","text":"oubao model and it IS \"Doubao writes\") |\n| MJ hero asset | = master-asset stage (MJ official API ada"},{"id":"p13s3","text":"pter to come; wanx/Seedream can substitute) |\n| image variations | = shot-assets stage (wanx ✅ verif"},{"id":"p13s4","text":"ied · **Doubao Seedream ✅ wired**) |\n| Seedance video | = video stage (**Doubao Seedance ✅** / jimen"},{"id":"p13s5","text":"g / kling / ComfyUI) |\n| JianYing final cut | = final-cut stage (JianYing draft export ✅ / ffmpeg ✅)"},{"id":"p13s6","text":" |\n- Every stage has a gate: auto / ask / manual.\n- Parallel shots, quota scheduler, style genome, d"},{"id":"p13s7","text":"istribution pack as before."},{"id":"p14s1","text":"- **Consistency asset library**: character/scene master assets + per-shot variations with automatic "},{"id":"p14s2","text":"reference-image injection into prompts (the motion-comic standard technique)\n- **Parallel shots**: b"},{"id":"p14s3","text":"atch submit → concurrent polling (configurable concurrency)\n- **Account pool (quota scheduler)**: mu"},{"id":"p14s4","text":"lti-account rotation per provider, per-day caps, exponential backoff on failure, automatic fallback "},{"id":"p14s5","text":"re-submit to the next healthy account mid-pipeline, full audit trail\n- **Credential vault**: `~/.wha"},{"id":"p14s6","text":"le/whale.json` (0600, atomic writes, follows `$DSH_HOME`), masked API responses, account management "},{"id":"p14s7","text":"UI in the plugin settings (鲸影账号 tab)\n- **Runtime account wiring**: accounts added in the UI feed str"},{"id":"p14s8","text":"aight into `whale_generate_video` — vault → pool pick (rotation/backoff) → per-account provider bind"},{"id":"p14s9","text":"ing (`src/host/account-providers.ts`, single-field credentials as plain strings, multi-field as JSON"},{"id":"p14s10","text":") → usage/health persisted back to the vault\n- **Style genome (memory)**: style DNA, shot-template s"},{"id":"p14s11","text":"coring evolution, retry feedback — persists across sessions\n[该节后续省略]"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"## Providers (verified matrix)"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"| Provider | Channel | Status |"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"| jimeng (即梦) | sessionid, free daily quota | ✅ protocol verified end-to-end; **text-to-video queue "},{"id":"p17s2","text":"stays `SystemBusy` even off-peak (0 credits consumed)** — free route is now: wanx images → image-to-"},{"id":"p17s3","text":"video |\n| tongyi-wanx (通义万相) | cookie+xsrf, free credits | ✅ **live-verified: real whale image gener"},{"id":"p17s4","text":"ated & downloaded** (free tier = text-to-image; video needs membership) |\n| kling official (可灵) | ac"},{"id":"p17s5","text":"cessKey:secretKey JWT, api-beijing.klingai.com | ✅ adapter written — not yet tested against a real k"},{"id":"p17s6","text":"ey |\n| kling via DashScope | `sk-` key | ✅ adapter written — not yet tested against a real key |\n| *"},{"id":"p17s7","text":"*kling-lipsync (可灵对口型)** | official JWT, `/v1/videos/lip-sync` | ✅ adapter written against the offic"},{"id":"p17s8","text":"ial 3-13 contract (audio2video + text2video voice modes), 8 tests — not yet tested against a real ke"},{"id":"p17s9","text":"y |\n| **wan video via DashScope (通义万相视频)** | `sk-` key | ✅ **LIVE-VERIFIED: real whale video generat"},{"id":"p17s10","text":"ed** (wan2.2-t2v-plus, 1920×1080 5s, ~90s turnaround) — ⚠️ metered at ¥0.70/s (1080p), NOT free quot"},{"id":"p17s11","text":"a; `demos/dashscope-wan-live.mp4` |\n| doubao (火山方舟) | ARK API key | ✅ Seedance video + **Seedream im"},{"id":"p17s12","text":"age** (assets) — not yet tested against a real key |\n| **doubao-web (豆包网页版)** | cookie, free web quo"},{"id":"p17s13","text":"ta | ✅ **live-replayed & parsed**: SSE chat for the LLM stages (story/script/shots) + image bot for "},{"id":"p17s14","text":"assets. Pro-tier free quota runs on a 7-day window (image bot pauses when spent; text keeps working)"},{"id":"p17s15","text":" |\n| ComfyUI local | workflow JSON builder + /prompt protocol | ✅ protocol-tested (mock server), rea"},{"id":"p17s16","text":"l GPU pending |\n| kling web (sessionid) | anti-bot one-time falcon token | 📄 anatomy documented; aut"},{"id":"p17s17","text":"omation needs a capture bridge (deferred) |"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"## Editing & distribution"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"- **Final cut with optional lip-sync stage**: with a `capabilities.lipSync` provider configured, eve"},{"id":"p19s2","text":"ry voiced shot runs audio-driven lip sync (video reference + audio base64) and the synced clip repla"},{"id":"p19s3","text":"ces the original on the timeline; failure falls back to the original clip, never blocking the render"},{"id":"p19s4","text":". Shots can also carry a pre-recorded `voiceFile` (external TTS/voice actor) that skips local TTS\n- "},{"id":"p19s5","text":"**ffmpeg auto-render** — verified end-to-end (synthetic clips → timeline → burned subtitles → audio "},{"id":"p19s6","text":"mix → final mp4, duration-checked)\n- **JianYing (剪映) draft export** — editable tracks/keyframes/subt"},{"id":"p19s7","text":"itles for manual polish; structure-validated\n- **say TTS** — real Chinese voiceover with zero API ke"},{"id":"p19s8","text":"ys: macOS `say`; Windows PowerShell SAPI (`System.Speech`, needs a Chinese voice pack). Any platform"},{"id":"p19s9","text":" can also plug external audio per shot via `voiceFile`\n- **Distribution pack** — platform specs + co"},{"id":"p19s10","text":"mpliance precheck for 4 Chinese platforms"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"## DSH integration (deep invocation)"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"- **Model tools**: `whale_story_presets` (5-genre content pack → pipeline script), `whale_storyboard"},{"id":"p21s2","text":"` (offline shot planning), `whale_generate_video` (provider routing), `whale_optimize_prompt` (pro-g"},{"id":"p21s3","text":"rade prompt upgrade), `whale_quality_review` (rule-level QC), `whale_comfyui_workflow` (ComfyUI work"},{"id":"p21s4","text":"flow JSON), `whale_self_audit` (project self-analysis)\n- **Host routes**: `/dsh-video-studio/health`"},{"id":"p21s5","text":", `/dsh-video-studio/runs`, `/dsh-video-studio/accounts` (GET list masked / POST add / DELETE remove"},{"id":"p21s6","text":"deo-studio/runs`, `/dsh-video-studio/accounts` (GET list masked / POST add / DELETE remove)\n[该节后续省略]"}],"truncated":true}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
